      "id": "blk_d7beae724b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The context-isolated bridge exposes window.xtrac with invoke(channel, payload) and onEvent(cb), rejects channels outside a hardcoded allow-list, and provides no renderer Node access. The main process separately validates the sending frame and renderer URL before any privileged handler runs."
